      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "https://hello.vrchat.com/blog/addressing-your-feedback\nThere is hope after all…\nVRC Developers, if you’re reading this, you’re on the right track.\nThank you.\nIf you can, please make sure avatar searching from the avatar menu and searching a creator’s avatars is a feature you’ll add to VRC too in the future. As well as any other features mentioned above or in the comments.\nThank you for thinking about us in the end.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
