  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2022-07-27T01:29:14.086Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "EAC is now put in place. With the mods gone now, I demand that the VRC Developers give us the features that EAC has taken from us directly put into VRChat. List is below:\n- More Avi Space with VRC+ (At Least 200 Avatars)\n- Allow Avatar Searching from the Avatar menu and from searching a creator’s avatars from social.\n- Controller Haptics when interacting with Physbones.\n- Limb Grabbing Options\n- Text to Speech\nYou’re on the right track with IK 2.0 and Physbones, especially since I no longer need the IKTweaks mod to stop the locomotion animation from interfering with FBT and since I no longer need the Dynamic Bone Collider mod to interact with dynamic bones. Now focus on delivering the features your team took from us.\nTo everyone else who has used mods, Feel free to drop in any other features not listed above that EAC has taken from you that you want in VRC again.",
